+# Auto Claim Dashboard
+
+Intentional junior-quality Auto insurance claim demo for code-review skill practice.
+
+## Run
+
+```bash
+cd examples/auto-claim-dashboard
+php artisan migrate:fresh --seed
+php artisan serve
+```
+
+Open http://127.0.0.1:8000
+
+## Demo login
+
+- Email: `alice.customer@insureco.test`
+- Password: `SuperSecret123!`
+
+Dashboard also auto-session Alice if you hit `/dashboard` without login.
